This creates a filterable list interface with:
- **Title heading** at the top
- **Segmented control** for filtering by status (All, Active, Pending, Completed)
- **Entity list** displaying all eight items with:
  - Title (name)
  - Subtitle (category/type)
  - Status indicator
  - One-line detail (meta information like due dates)

The data model contains eight sample items with different statuses that can be filtered using the segmented control.
